	(text "Pico C must hold its four lines to the 74HCT595 low whenever +5V_SW is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12 50 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e69c17e5-c2f6-5a02-9653-7316e222e5b2")
	)
	(text "Cartridge connector and the dump circuit for emulation mode"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12 14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b28ca98e-970f-55da-9e34-5e0999ee3650")
	)
	(text "Their outputs can be switched on only while DIP switch 1 is set to emulation AND Pico C raises C_DUMP_EN (Q with its source on the switch)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12 35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "abe71e8f-499e-515b-951c-f6159549aa37")
	)
	(text "J8 is a new 60-pin card-edge connector.  Pin 45 carries the board's sound to the cartridge, pin 46 brings it back."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "89a63f30-6567-516c-b708-042e4e924b84")
	)
	(text "Dump circuit: with the CPU and PPU sockets empty, Pico C reads the cartridge through shift registers and hands the data to Pico A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0b04641e-4522-5d9a-9cc4-746b7a8a4d4c")
	)
	(text "meets a PPU output has 1 k in series: a PPU left in its socket by mistake sees at most 5 mA per pin.  The firmware checks for chips first."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12 45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b0947465-bb65-5a58-96f0-beadcd98fab5")
	)
	(text "C_DUMP_EN also holds the CPU in reset (all its bus pins are released then).  A PPU cannot be switched off its bus, so every driver that"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12 40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "40eaf482-d137-55de-bb85-b79ac8ff0abd")
	)
	(text "The six 74HCT595 run from +5V_SW and take the 3.3 V signals of Pico C through 470 ohm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12 30 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
